		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Shipping</h2><p>Free worldwide shipping on orders over $150. Standard delivery takes 5–7 business days.</p><h2>Returns</h2><p>Returns accepted within 30 days. Items must be unworn with tags attached.</p><h2>Sizing</h2><p>Refer to the size guide on each product page. Contact us for fit advice.</p>]]></content:encoded>
